// Title: AWS CloudTrail Important Change
// ID: 4db60cc0-36fb-42b7-9b58-a5b53019fb74
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: vitaliy0x1
// Date: 2020-01-21
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.002
// Description: Detects disabling, deleting and updating of a Trail
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (eventSource == "cloudtrail.amazonaws.com" and (eventName == "StopLogging" or eventName == "UpdateTrail" or eventName == "DeleteTrail"))
